            <ArticleTitle>Cystic cervical intramedullary schwannoma with syringomyelia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>224-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of cervical intramedullary cystic schwannoma associated with segmental syrinx in a young adult without evidence of neurofibromatosis. The relevant literature is reviewed.</AbstractText>
